Description: compact update alert for KDE Plasma
 Checks APT and system/user Flatpak sources when a Plasma session starts.
 It displays a compact Qt 6 alert only when updates exist and opens Discover
 when the user chooses to update.
 .
 The APT index refresh runs through a sudoers rule that allows only the
 fixed command "apt-get update" without a password; installing updates is
 left to Discover.
